{"title":"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In any isosceles triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/a/f3ac37c9fa391eebb9601bfaca8bfbfaabdf5ca1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB = AC$\" width=\"80\" height=\"13\" />, the altitude <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> bisects the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/3/7f35fe2c75c113f7cdd2f6c59a1ca76e728c540b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD = DC$\" width=\"84\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2a\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 2a</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2a\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a_Part_i\" title=\"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a Part i\">2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a Part i</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2a_Part_ii\" title=\"2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a Part ii\">2011 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 2a Part ii</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017224814\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.021 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 41/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1004/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 815/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.374      1 2011_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_2\n100.00%   13.374      1 -total\n 39.35%    5.263      1 Template:Image_needed\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:36986:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017224814 and revision id 285889. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}